<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #1a1a1a;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f5f5f5;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      border: 1px solid #eeeeee;
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #636b2f 0%, #4f5625 100%);
      padding: 30px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #ffffff;
      border-bottom: 4px solid #bac095;
    }
    .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; }
    .header p  { margin: 6px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.8; }
    .content { padding: 36px 30px 28px; }
    .timestamp-box {
      background: #f9fff3;
      border: 1px solid #bac095;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #555;
      margin: 20px 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .security-alert {
      background: #fff5f5;
      border-left: 4px solid #c53030;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 24px 0;
    }
    .security-alert-title {
      color: #c53030;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 14px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      margin: 0 0 8px 0;
    }
    .security-alert p {
      margin: 0 0 16px 0;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #2d3748;
    }
    .btn-emergency {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      background: #ffffff;
      color: #c53030;
      border: 2px solid #c53030;
      border-radius: 5px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
    .tips-box {
      background: #f9fafb;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 18px 20px;
      margin-top: 24px;
    }
    .tips-box p {
      margin: 0 0 10px 0;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #444;
    }
    .tips-box ul {
      margin: 0;
      padding-left: 20px;
    }
    .tips-box li {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #555;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px 30px;
      background-color: #f9fafb;
      color: #888;
      font-size: 12px;
      border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f5f5f5;">

  <div class="container" style="background-color:#ffffff;">

    <div class="header" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#636b2f 0%,#4f5625 100%); padding:30px; text-align:center; color:#ffffff; border-bottom:4px solid #bac095;">
      <h1 style="margin:0; font-size:24px; font-weight:800;">Password Changed</h1>
      <p style="margin:6px 0 0 0; font-size:13px; opacity:0.8;">Security update on your FormaChat account</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content" style="padding:36px 30px 28px;">

      <p style="font-size:16px; margin:0 0 16px 0; color:#1a1a1a;">Hello,</p>
      <p style="font-size:15px; margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#444;">Your FormaChat account password was successfully changed.</p>

      <div style="background:#f9fff3; border:1px solid #bac095; border-radius:8px; padding:14px 18px; font-size:14px; color:#555; margin:20px 0;">
        🕐 Changed on <strong style="color:#1a1a1a;">{{changedAt}}</strong>
      </div>

      <div class="security-alert" style="background:#fff5f5; border-left:4px solid #c53030; border-radius:6px; padding:20px; margin:24px 0;">
        <p class="security-alert-title" style="color:#c53030; font-weight:800; font-size:14px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.5px; margin:0 0 8px 0;">⚠️ Didn't make this change?</p>
        <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0; font-size:14px; color:#2d3748;">
          If you didn't change your password, your account may be compromised. Act immediately — click below to contact our security team and lock your account.
        </p>
        <a href="mailto:support@formachat.com?subject=URGENT:%20Unauthorized%20Password%20Change&body=My%20account%20password%20was%20changed%20without%20my%20permission.%20Please%20lock%20my%20account%20immediately."
           class="btn-emergency"
           style="display:inline-block; padding:10px 20px; background:#ffffff; color:#c53030; border:2px solid #c53030; border-radius:5px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:700; font-size:13px;">
          🔒 Lock My Account Now
        </a>
      </div>

      <p style="font-size:15px; margin:0 0 4px 0; color:#444;">
        If <strong>you</strong> made this change, you're all set. Here are a few tips to keep your account secure:
      </p>

      <div class="tips-box" style="background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:18px 20px; margin-top:16px;">
        <ul style="margin:0; padding-left:20px;">
          <li style="font-size:13px; color:#555; margin-bottom:8px;">Use a strong, unique password generated by a password manager.</li>
          <li style="font-size:13px; color:#555; margin-bottom:8px;">Never reuse the same password across multiple sites.</li>
          <li style="font-size:13px; color:#555;">Enable two-factor authentication (2FA) for an extra layer of security.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <p style="margin-top:28px; font-size:15px; color:#1a1a1a;">Stay secure,<br>The FormaChat Team</p>

    </div>

    <div class="footer" style="text-align:center; padding:20px 30px; background-color:#f9fafb; color:#888; font-size:12px; border-top:1px solid #eee;">
      <p style="margin:4px 0;">&copy; {{currentYear}} FormaChat. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p style="margin:4px 0; color:#aaa;">Secure System Alert — do not reply to this email.</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
